# Root ignores for this repository.
#
# Each panel keeps its own .gitignore, but those use root-anchored rules like
# `/node_modules`, which stop matching once the panel sits in a subdirectory.
# These are unanchored so they apply at any depth.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
coverage/
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
